@startuml get-manager-user-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/user/{pk}
caption CRB-91 · 회원 상세 (읽기 전용). 연락처 값 · OAuth 식별자 · 토큰 · 명함 사진은 응답에 넣지 않음 (연락처 · 명함은 화면의 보기 버튼이 별도 API로 조회하고 열람 기록을 남김)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseUUIDPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerUserController" as Controller
participant "ManagerUserService" as Service
participant "AdminUserRepository" as UserRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/user/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 uuid가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 Validation failed (uuid is expected)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getUser(pk)
Controller -> Service: getUser(pk)
Service -> UserRepository: findDetailByPk(pk)
UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users WHERE pk
PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row | 없음
alt 없는 회원
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 User not found
end
par 동시에 조회 — 모두 user_pk 기준
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT user_oauth_account (provider · email · created_at · last_login_at)\nprovider_sub는 SELECT하지 않음
else
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT coffee_chat_contact (kakao_enabled · email_enabled)\nphone · email은 SELECT하지 않음
else
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT user_consent ORDER BY agreed_at DESC, pk DESC
else
  alt type = student
    UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student (학교 이메일 · verified_at)\n+ 최신 student_profile (학교 · 학과 · 관심분야 · 활동)\n+ 보낸 커피챗 요청 수 (서브쿼리 count)
  else type = graduated
    UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT graduated (verified_at · 명함 등록 여부) + graduated_profile\n(닉네임 · 회사 · 부서 · 직무 · 해시태그 · 링크)\n+ 받은 커피챗 요청 수 (서브쿼리 count)
  end
else
end
PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: rows
UserRepository --> Service: detail
note right of Service
  탈퇴 완료(is_deleted)면 purge로 지워진 값은 null — 그대로 내려줌
  가입 미완료(pending)면 profile · contact는 null
  [명함 보기] 버튼: 기존 GET /api/manager/v1/business-card/{graduatedPk} 호출
    (graduated_pk 내려줌, 열람 기록 admin_access_log는 그 API가 남김)
  [연락처 보기] 버튼: GET /api/manager/v1/user/{pk}/contact 호출 (manager/get-user-pk-contact.puml, 열람 기록을 남김)
  하단 커피챗 목록: 기존 GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/request?student_pk= 또는 graduated_pk= 재사용
    (재학생은 보낸 요청, 현업자는 받은 요청. 새 API 없음. student_pk · graduated_pk를 내려줌)
end note
Service --> Controller: UserDetailDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { pk, name, email, type, status, withdrawal_state, created_at, updated_at, last_active_at, withdraw_requested_at,\noauth_accounts: [{ provider, email, created_at, last_login_at }],\ncontact_methods: { kakao_enabled, email_enabled } | null,\nconsents: [{ type, version, agreed_at, revoked_at }],\nstudent: { student_pk, school_email, verified_at, school, department, interests, activities } | null,\ngraduated: { graduated_pk, verified_at, has_business_card, nickname, company, department, job, hashtags, links } | null,\ncoffee_chat_request_count }

@enduml
